# Frontend

- UI strings are Chinese. Energy is **能量**, never XP / 经验.
- `src/lib/api.ts` is the only `invoke()` site for pages. It goes through `src/lib/invoke.ts` (Tauri, or `src/lib/preview/` when `VITE_PREVIEW=1`). Do not import `@tauri-apps/api` from a page or component.
- Pages consume view-models from `src/lib/*`; tests colocate as `src/lib/*.test.ts`. Cloud-backup helpers: `src/lib/cloudSync.ts`.
- Run frontend tests with `npx vitest run --dir src` (never unscoped — `.worktrees/` copies inflate counts).
- Colour: `src/index.css` `--cat-*` and `src/lib/theme.ts` (`categoryColor` / `categoryColorAt`). No hex / rgb literals in components. Merge classes with `cn()` from `src/lib/utils.ts`.
- Pages: `Today.tsx` / `Tasks.tsx` / `Stats.tsx` / `Shop.tsx` / `Settings.tsx`. Rail id `week` is the 统计 tab (`src/lib/rail.ts`); id `tasks` is 任务.
- Each page is `<>{PageHeader}{scroll area}</>`. Keep `TRAFFIC_LIGHT_STRIP` / `TOOLBAR_ROW` / `BRAND_ROW` / `TOOLBAR_PAD_BOTTOM` in sync with the sidebar brand block.
- Primitives in `src/components/ui/*` are hand-rolled (no Radix). Blue = primary, green = on/healthy, amber = warning, red = destructive only.
- Tailwind v4 CSS-first (`@tailwindcss/vite`). No `tailwind.config.*`, no PostCSS. Tokens are bare HSL triplets via `hsl(var(--x))`.
- T15 is not done: 统计 / 商店 / 今日 still read the live DB. Do not pretend wallet numbers come from `merged.db`.
